You take advantage of unwary foes (those at or above 90% life). Against these targets, Shoot, Steady Shot and Headshot bleed targets for [30%, 53%, 71%, 86%, 100% (TL1-5)] additional damage over 5 turns and have a 50% increased chance to mark (if capable of marking).

In addition, your Steady Shot, Shoot and Headshot now restore [1.5, 2.5, 3.3, 3.9, 4.5 (TL1-5)] stamina on hit.
